LeetCode 6 – Zigzag Conversion
Problem Description

The string "PAYPALISHIRING" is written in a zigzag pattern across a given number of rows and then read row by row.

Given a string s and an integer numRows, return the string formed by reading the zigzag pattern row by row.

Approach: Row-by-Row Traversal (Mathematical Pattern)

This solution uses a mathematical observation to generate the zigzag pattern without actually constructing a 2D matrix.

The characters follow a repeating cycle when traversing the zigzag pattern.

